    "text": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0070_a6cc714a7953.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 124px;\" /><br /><br />From energy conservation,<br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></msqrt></math><br /><br />At <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math><br /><br />So net force at <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>65&nbsp;</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math>"
